# German translation of the salsa theme.
#
# English is the source language: the msgids are the literals passed to t(),
# formatPlural() and TranslatableMarkup() in the theme's PHP, and the strings in
# its Twig templates. Imported into Drupal's locale storage with:
#
#   drush locale:import de themes/custom/salsa/translations/de.po \
#     --type=customized --override=all
#
# Informal "du".
#
